qwertycoin-ts
==============

This repository is derived from woodser/monero-ts.

Upstream:
- https://github.com/woodser/monero-ts

Wallet bridge:
- external/monero-cpp points to the Qwertycoin bridge fork:
  https://github.com/qwertycoin-org/qwertycoin-cpp

Core submodule:
- qwertycoin-cpp/external/monero-project points to the Qwertycoin v2 core
  repository at the pinned commit recorded by the submodule.

